<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Swiss Re.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Swiss Re.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel says it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Reinsurance Co.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,400.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	6.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.75 CHF		  GEARING	10.50 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.FEB.97-07.JAN.98   PAYDATE	14.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,442.00 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
